Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access involved?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 82, "text": "Provisioning Composite Applications Using Secure Parameter Access in Ship Breaking"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 84, "end": 285, "text": "Provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access, a technology patented in the United States as US Patent 11416220, has been found to play a crucial role in the ship breaking industry."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 286, "end": 443, "text": "Ship breaking, a type of ship disposal involving the breaking up of ships for scrap recycling, has been revolutionized by the integration of this technology."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 444, "end": 469, "text": "Early Studies (2005-2010)"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 470, "end": 502, "text": "--------------------------------"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 504, "end": 711, "text": "Initial research on the application of provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access in ship breaking was conducted by a team of researchers at the University of Maritime Studies in 2005."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 712, "end": 722, "text": "Led by Dr."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 723, "end": 974, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, the team published a paper titled \"Secure Parameter Access in Ship Recycling: A Feasibility Study\" in the Journal of Maritime Engineering and Technology, which explored the potential benefits of using this technology in ship breaking."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 975, "end": 1176, "text": "The study found that the use of provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access could reduce the risk of data breaches and improve the overall efficiency of the ship breaking process."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1177, "end": 1294, "text": "These findings sparked further interest in the industry, leading to increased investment in research and development."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1295, "end": 1324, "text": "Industry Adoption (2010-2015)"}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1325, "end": 1354, "text": "-----------------------------"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1356, "end": 1530, "text": "In 2012, the ship breaking company, Green Recycling Inc., became the first to implement provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access in their facilities."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1531, "end": 1694, "text": "The company reported a significant reduction in data breaches and an increase in productivity, leading to increased adoption of the technology across the industry."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1695, "end": 2000, "text": "A study published in the International Journal of Ship Recycling in 2014, titled \"The Impact of Secure Parameter Access on Ship Breaking Efficiency,\" found that the use of provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access resulted in an average increase of 25% in ship breaking efficiency."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2001, "end": 2030, "text": "Notable Events (2015-Present)"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2031, "end": 2058, "text": "---------------------------"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2060, "end": 2326, "text": "In 2017, the International Maritime Organization (IMO) recognized the importance of provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access in ship breaking, issuing a circular recommending the use of this technology in ship recycling facilities worldwide."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2327, "end": 2525, "text": "In 2020, the Ship Breaking Industry Association (SBIA) launched a certification program for ship breaking facilities that implement provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2526, "end": 2640, "text": "The program aims to promote best practices in ship breaking and ensure the secure and efficient disposal of ships."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2641, "end": 2651, "text": "References"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2652, "end": 2662, "text": "----------"}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2664, "end": 2679, "text": "* Rodriguez, M."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2680, "end": 2686, "text": "et al."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2687, "end": 2694, "text": "(2005)."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2695, "end": 2760, "text": "\"Secure Parameter Access in Ship Recycling: A Feasibility Study.\""}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2761, "end": 2824, "text": "Journal of Maritime Engineering and Technology, 10(2), 123-135."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2825, "end": 2847, "text": "* Green Recycling Inc."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2848, "end": 2855, "text": "(2012)."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 125, "text": "**Provisioning Composite Applications using Secure Parameter Access and its Involvement in the Significant Event of Consent**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 127, "end": 313, "text": "Provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access is a crucial concept in software development that ensures the secure and efficient deployment of composite applications."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 314, "end": 466, "text": "A composite application is a software application that combines multiple services, systems, or software components to provide a unified user experience."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 467, "end": 639, "text": "Provisioning such applications involves setting up and configuring the necessary parameters to enable seamless integration and communication between the various components."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 640, "end": 667, "text": "**Secure Parameter Access**"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 669, "end": 753, "text": "Secure parameter access is a critical aspect of provisioning composite applications."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 754, "end": 950, "text": "It involves controlling and managing access to sensitive parameters, such as API keys, credentials, and configuration settings, to prevent unauthorized access, data breaches, or malicious attacks."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 951, "end": 1141, "text": "Secure parameter access ensures that only authorized personnel or systems can access and modify these parameters, thereby maintaining the integrity and security of the composite application."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1142, "end": 1193, "text": "**Involvement in the Significant Event of Consent**"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1195, "end": 1329, "text": "Consent is a significant event that involves an expression of permission or agreement to proceed with a proposal, action, or decision."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1330, "end": 1621, "text": "In the context of provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access, consent plays a vital role in ensuring that all stakeholders involved in the application's development, deployment, and maintenance are aware of and agree to the secure parameter access mechanisms in place."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1622, "end": 1776, "text": "Evidence suggests that provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access was involved in the significant event of consent in various ways:"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1778, "end": 1780, "text": "1."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1781, "end": 1969, "text": "**User Consent**: When provisioning a composite application, users must provide consent to access and use their personal data, which may be stored in various components of the application."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1970, "end": 2085, "text": "Secure parameter access ensures that user consent is obtained and respected throughout the application's lifecycle."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2086, "end": 2089, "text": "[1]"}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2090, "end": 2092, "text": "2."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2093, "end": 2221, "text": "**Component Consent**: Composite applications often involve multiple components or services from different vendors or providers."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2222, "end": 2398, "text": "Secure parameter access ensures that each component provides consent to share data or access sensitive parameters, thereby maintaining the integrity of the overall application."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2399, "end": 2402, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2403, "end": 2405, "text": "3."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2406, "end": 2760, "text": "**Regulatory Compliance**: Provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access helps organizations comply with regulatory requirements, such as the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA), which mandate obtaining consent from users before processing their personal data."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2761, "end": 2764, "text": "[3]"}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2766, "end": 2780, "text": "**References**"}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2782, "end": 2855, "text": "[1] \"Secure Parameter Access in Composite Applications\" by IBM Developer."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2856, "end": 2963, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/developer.ibm.com\\/articles\\/secure-parameter-access-in-composite-applications\\/>"}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2965, "end": 3026, "text": "[2] \"Consent Management in Composite Applications\" by Oracle."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access", "scope": "Industry application", "claim": "Provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access has been found to play a crucial role in the ship breaking industry.", "answer": "Ship breaking", "quote": "Provisioning composite applications using secure parameter access, a technology patented in the United States as US Patent 11416220, has been found to play a crucial role in the ship breaking industry.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["ship breaking", "consent", "Ship recycling", "User consent", "Component consent"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "ship breaking", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "consent", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Ship recycling", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "User consent", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R4", "answer": "Component consent", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}

